*> Acceptance test, US14 combat through the real play path (docs/protocol/17 sections 4.1 to 4.7 and 5.1; Attack 0x01 in, Damage Event, Hurt
*> Animation, Set Health, Set Entity Motion and Container Set Slot out): Alice hits Bobby with a standard-set iron_sword. The world opens as the
*> cobolcraft set and the core tables are rebuilt from the standard set (TEST-STANDARD-TABLES); the enchantment rows come from
*> core/tests/fixtures/wire-registry (efficiency 0, knockback 1, protection 2, sharpness 3, smite 4, sweeping_edge 5, unbreaking 6).
*> Alice (entity 1) stands at (20.5, 101, 20.5) facing east, Bobby (entity 2) 2 blocks east, both survival with 20 health and food 17.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US14-ATTACK-WIRE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY CMENU.
 COPY COREAPI.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY ETIDS.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(16).
 01 WS-NAME-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
 01 WS-ALICE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BOB                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-A                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-B                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BOB-ID              BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOVE                BINARY-LONG VALUE 31.
 01 WS-FX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 20.5.
 01 WS-FY                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 101.
 01 WS-FZ                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 20.5.
 01 WS-BX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 22.5.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE -90.
 01 WS-PITCH               FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-FLAGS               BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-FLOOR-DIM           BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-FLOOR-X             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FLOOR-Y             BINARY-LONG VALUE 100.
 01 WS-FLOOR-Z             BINARY-LONG VALUE 20.
 01 WS-FLOOR-STATE         BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-TICKS               BINARY-LONG VALUE 12.
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(4096).
 01 WS-DIR                 PIC X(1100) VALUE "core/tests/fixtures/wire-registry".
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ITEM-ID             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW                 PIC X(270).
 01 WS-SWORD               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CHEST               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HANDLE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ENCH                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DAMAGE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HUNDREDTHS          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E1                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-ROWNO-A            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROWNO-B            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-ROW             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-ID              BINARY-LONG VALUE 3.
 01 WS-MOB-X               FLOAT-LONG VALUE 23.5.
 01 WS-MOB-Z               FLOAT-LONG VALUE 20.5.
 01 WS-MOB-HEALTH          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-TYPE            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM1                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-EFFECT-ID           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AMPLIFIER           BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-DURATION            BINARY-LONG VALUE 400.
 01 WS-EFFECT-FLAGS        BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-STICK               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ITEM-KEY            PIC X(112).
 01 WS-WANT-DAMAGE         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TOOL-ITEM           BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "TEST-SETTINGS" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE 0 TO CS-DEFAULT-MODE
     MOVE 2 TO CS-VIEW-DISTANCE
     MOVE 0 TO CS-HOSTILE-MOBS
     PERFORM OPEN-AND-JOIN

     MOVE "acceptance US14 given Alice holds a charged iron_sword when she attacks Bobby then he takes 6, is knocked back and the sword loses 1"
         TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 14 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 the victim also gets Set Entity Motion (0x67) after Set Health: the 0.4 hit knockback" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-IDS" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-IDS" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "25 43 106 103" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Alice, who sees the hit, gets Damage Event, Hurt Animation and the Container Set Slot of the damaged sword" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-IDS" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT
     MOVE "25 43 20" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "25 43 20 115 25 43 20" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 each accepted hit costs the sword 1 durability (item_damage_per_attack), two hits so far" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-SWORD WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E1
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a second hit at once is a weak swing inside the hurt window: ignored, no packet, no durability" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT
     MOVE PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-SWORD WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE "acceptance US14 the ignored hit left the sword at damage 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E1
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Sharpness 3 from the registry row adds 2.0 to a charged hit: 6 + 2 = 8" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 3 TO WS-ENCH
     MOVE 3 TO WS-LEVEL
     MOVE PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-ADD-ENCHANT" USING WS-HANDLE WS-ENCH WS-LEVEL
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 12 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a critical hit (falling, not on the ground, not sprinting, charged) is 1.5 x the weapon part: 9" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 1 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 2)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 2)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 2)
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 0 TO PL-ON-GROUND(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE))
     COMPUTE PL-FALL-START(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE)) = PL-Y(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE)) + 1
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 11 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 armor: an iron_chestplate (6 armor points) takes the 6 damage to 5.28 and loses 1 durability" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO PL-ON-GROUND(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE))
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     MOVE WS-CHEST TO MN-EQUIP-ITEM(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB), 3)
     MOVE 1 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB), 3)
     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB), 3)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     COMPUTE WS-HUNDREDTHS ROUNDED = PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB)) * 100
     MOVE WS-HUNDREDTHS TO WS-E1
     MOVE MN-EQUIP-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB), 3) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-CHEST WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E2
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "health " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " chest damage " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "health 1472 chest damage 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Protection 3 on the chestplate (registry row, damage_protection 3.0) takes 5.28 to 5.28 x 22 / 25 = 4.6464" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 2 TO WS-ENCH
     MOVE 3 TO WS-LEVEL
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-ADD-ENCHANT" USING WS-HANDLE WS-ENCH WS-LEVEL
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO MN-EQUIP-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB), 3)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     COMPUTE WS-HUNDREDTHS ROUNDED = PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB)) * 100
     MOVE WS-HUNDREDTHS TO WS-E1
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "health " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "health 1535" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a sword at damage 249 of 250 breaks on the next accepted hit: the slot is emptied and Alice is sent the slot" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     MOVE 249 TO WS-DAMAGE
     CALL "SP-SET-DAMAGE" USING WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-IDS" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-IDS" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT
     MOVE PL-SLOT-COUNT(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1) TO WS-E1
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "count " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " ids " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "count 0 ids 25 43 20" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE "acceptance US14 with player combat off an attack on a player does nothing" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     MOVE 0 TO CS-PLAYER-COMBAT
     MOVE CORE-SETTINGS TO CW-SETTINGS
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT
     MOVE 1 TO CS-PLAYER-COMBAT
     MOVE CORE-SETTINGS TO CW-SETTINGS

     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-B, 3)
     MOVE "acceptance US14 a bare hand (an empty held slot) does 1 at full charge" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 8 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 19 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Weakness takes 4 off the attack damage: a bare hand then does nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 17 TO WS-EFFECT-ID
     CALL "EFFECT-ADD" USING WS-ROWNO-A WS-EFFECT-ID WS-AMPLIFIER WS-DURATION WS-EFFECT-FLAGS
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT
     CALL "EFFECT-REMOVE" USING WS-ROWNO-A WS-EFFECT-ID

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Blindness forbids the critical hit: a falling charged sword hit stays 6" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 14 TO WS-EFFECT-ID
     CALL "EFFECT-ADD" USING WS-ROWNO-A WS-EFFECT-ID WS-AMPLIFIER WS-DURATION WS-EFFECT-FLAGS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     MOVE 0 TO PL-ON-GROUND(WS-ROWNO-A)
     COMPUTE PL-FALL-START(WS-ROWNO-A) = PL-Y(WS-ROWNO-A) + 1
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 14 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT
     CALL "EFFECT-REMOVE" USING WS-ROWNO-A WS-EFFECT-ID
     MOVE 1 TO PL-ON-GROUND(WS-ROWNO-A)

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a sprinting charged hit with Knockback 1 adds the sprint and enchantment knockback: still 6 damage" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ENCH
     MOVE 1 TO WS-LEVEL
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-ADD-ENCHANT" USING WS-HANDLE WS-ENCH WS-LEVEL
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SPRINTING(WS-ROWNO-A)
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     MOVE "damage 2 type 29 source 2 | hurt 2 | health 14 food 17" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-TEXT
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SPRINTING(WS-ROWNO-A)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a hit on a mob entity row goes to HEALTH-MOB-DAMAGE: the mob is hurt or defeated" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO CS-HOSTILE-MOBS
     MOVE ET-SODGRAZER TO WS-MOB-TYPE
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM1 WS-MOB-TYPE WS-MOB-X WS-FY WS-MOB-Z WS-YAW WS-MOB-ROW
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-MOB-ROW) TO WS-MOB-HEALTH
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     MOVE EN-ID(WS-MOB-ROW) TO WS-MOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-MOB-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-E1
     IF EN-USED(WS-MOB-ROW) = 0 OR EN-HEALTH(WS-MOB-ROW) < WS-MOB-HEALTH
         MOVE 1 TO WS-E1
     END-IF
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "hurt " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "hurt 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 the wear of an iron_axe per hit is 2, of a mace 1, of an iron_shovel 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "iron_axe" TO WS-ITEM-KEY
     MOVE 2 TO WS-WANT-DAMAGE
     PERFORM HIT-WITH
     MOVE "mace" TO WS-ITEM-KEY
     MOVE 1 TO WS-WANT-DAMAGE
     PERFORM HIT-WITH
     MOVE "iron_shovel" TO WS-ITEM-KEY
     MOVE 2 TO WS-WANT-DAMAGE
     PERFORM HIT-WITH
     MOVE "2 1 2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a piece without durability (a stick in the helmet slot) takes no wear; a chestplate at damage 239 of 240 breaks" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE "stick" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-STICK WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE WS-STICK TO MN-EQUIP-ITEM(WS-ROWNO-B, 4)
     MOVE 1 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-B, 4)
     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-VAR(WS-ROWNO-B, 4)
     MOVE WS-CHEST TO MN-EQUIP-ITEM(WS-ROWNO-B, 3)
     MOVE 1 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-B, 3)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     MOVE 239 TO WS-DAMAGE
     CALL "SP-SET-DAMAGE" USING WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO MN-EQUIP-VAR(WS-ROWNO-B, 3)
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     MOVE MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-B, 3) TO WS-E1
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "chest " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "chest 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     STOP RUN.

 PREP-HIT.
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(WS-ROWNO-B)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT.

*> Alice hits Bobby with the item of WS-ITEM-KEY in slot 0; its damage is appended to TL-OBSERVED.
 HIT-WITH.
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-ITEM-KEY WS-TOOL-ITEM WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     MOVE WS-TOOL-ITEM TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-ROWNO-B, 3)
     PERFORM PREP-HIT
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     MOVE PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-ROWNO-A, 1) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-TOOL-ITEM WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E1
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

*> Opens the world, joins Alice and Bobby, the standard tables and the enchantment rows; Alice's slot 0 holds an iron_sword.
 OPEN-AND-JOIN.
     CALL "TEST-OPEN-WORLD" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE "Alice" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-ALICE
     MOVE "Bobby" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-BOB
     MOVE 17 TO PL-FOOD(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SATURATION(CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB))
     PERFORM VARYING WS-FLOOR-X FROM 20 BY 1 UNTIL WS-FLOOR-X > 25
         CALL "WORLD-SET-BLOCK" USING WS-FLOOR-DIM WS-FLOOR-X WS-FLOOR-Y WS-FLOOR-Z WS-FLOOR-STATE
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "TEST-MOVE" USING WS-ALICE WS-MOVE WS-FX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-PITCH WS-FLAGS
     CALL "TEST-MOVE" USING WS-BOB WS-MOVE WS-BX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-PITCH WS-FLAGS
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE) TO WS-ROWNO-A
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB) TO WS-ROWNO-B
     CALL "TEST-STANDARD-TABLES"
     CALL "REGISTRY-LOAD-ALL" USING WS-DIR WS-STATUS
     MOVE "iron_sword" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SWORD WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "iron_chestplate" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-CHEST WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE), 1)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-TICKS
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-ALICE WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT.

 CHECK.
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.

 CHECK-TEXT.
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US14-ATTACK-WIRE.

 COPY CORETEST.
